🔹 Core Frameworks

langchain → The base framework.

langgraph → For building agentic workflows using graphs.

🔹 LLM Providers

openai → OpenAI GPT (ChatGPT, GPT-4o).

anthropic → Anthropic’s Claude.

langchain-google-genai → Google Gemini.

cohere → Cohere’s models.

ai21 → AI21 Jurassic & Jamba models.

huggingface_hub → Hugging Face models (hosted / transformers).

ollama → Local LLMs with Ollama.

🔹 Vector Databases (RAG)

faiss-cpu or faiss-gpu → FAISS vector store.

qdrant-client → Qdrant DB.

weaviate-client → Weaviate DB.

pinecone-client → Pinecone DB.

chromadb → Chroma DB (lightweight, open source).

milvus → Milvus DB.

🔹 Tools & Utilities

langchain-experimental → Cutting-edge experimental tools.

langserve → Expose LangChain as APIs.

tiktoken → Tokenizer (for OpenAI models).

pypdf / pdfplumber → For PDF loaders.

bs4 (BeautifulSoup) → For web scraping loaders.

✅ Industry Hot Picks (2025):
If you’re aiming for job-ready projects, the most in-demand stack is:

langchain, langgraph

openai, anthropic, langchain-google-genai, huggingface_hub

faiss-cpu or qdrant-client (for vector DB)

langserve (for deploying as APIs)